  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAI-From Hate Speech to Inter-Communal Harmony</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to tackle the challenges of hate speech against ethnic and religious minorities in Myanmar by building capacities and networks of grassroots organizations in Sagaing, Dawei, and Hpa-an. Additionally, awareness raising and advocacy will be conducted at the national level, in an effort to improve government accountability and conduct.</narrative>
  </description>
